#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:2
msgid "Example projects"
msgstr "示例项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:4
msgid ""
"The following example projects show a rich variety of uses of Read the Docs."
" You can use them for inspiration, for learning and for recipes to start "
"your own documentation projects. View the *rendered* version of each project"
" and then head over to the Git repository to see how it's done and reuse the"
" code."
msgstr ""
"以下示例项目展示了 Read the Docs 的丰富用法。你可以从中获取灵感、学习经验，并借鉴方法来启动自己的文档项目。查看每个项目的*渲染* "
"版本，然后前往 Git 仓库了解其实现方式并复用代码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:9
msgid "Real-life examples"
msgstr "真实案例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:11
msgid ""
"We maintain an Awesome List where you can contribute new shiny examples of "
"using Read the Docs. Please refer to the instructions on how to submit new "
"entries on `Awesome Read the Docs Projects <https://github.com/readthedocs-"
"examples/awesome-read-the-docs>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们维护了一份 Awesome 列表，你可以在其中贡献使用 Read the Docs 的新颖示例。关于如何提交新条目的说明，请参阅 `Awesome "
"Read the Docs Projects <https://github.com/readthedocs-examples/awesome-"
"read-the-docs>`__。"

