#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:66
msgid "Contributing an example project"
msgstr "贡献示例项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:68
msgid ""
"We would love to add more examples that showcase features of Read the Docs "
"or great tools or methods to build documentation projects."
msgstr "我们非常希望收录更多示例，展示 Read the Docs 的功能，或构建文档项目的优秀工具与方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:70
msgid "We **require** that an example project:"
msgstr "我们**要求** 示例项目："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:72
msgid ""
"is **hosted and maintained by you** in its own Git repository, "
"``example-<topic>``."
msgstr "由**你本人托管和维护** 在独立的 Git 仓库中，命名为 ``example-<topic>``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:73
msgid "contains a README."
msgstr "包含 README。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:74
msgid "uses a ``.readthedocs.yaml`` configuration."
msgstr "使用 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:75
msgid ""
"is added to the above list by **opening a PR** targeting `examples.rst "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/blob/main/docs/user/examples.rst>`_"
" file from our documentation."
msgstr ""
"通过**提交 PR** 添加到上述列表，目标为我们文档中的 `examples.rst "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/blob/main/docs/user/examples.rst>`_"
" 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:78
msgid "We **recommend** that your project:"
msgstr "我们**建议** 你的项目："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:80
msgid "has **continuous integration and PR builds**."
msgstr "具备**持续集成和 PR 构建**。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:81
msgid "is **versioned** as a real software project, i.e. using git tags."
msgstr "像真实软件项目一样**进行版本管理**，例如使用 git 标签。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:82
msgid ""
"covers your most important scenarios, but references external real-life "
"projects whenever possible."
msgstr "涵盖你最重要的场景，但尽可能引用外部真实项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:83
msgid ""
"has a minimal tech stack -- or whatever you feel comfortable about "
"maintaining."
msgstr "使用最小化的技术栈——或任何你有信心维护的技术栈。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:84
msgid "copies from an existing example project as a template to get started."
msgstr "从现有示例项目复制作为模板来快速开始。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/examples.rst:86
msgid "We're excited to see what you come up with!"
msgstr "我们期待看到你的成果！"

